DESCRIPTION:In celebration of the Summer Solstice\, we have a special tasting of all five wines from our Pinot Hill vineyard. Experience the difference in morning and afternoon sunlight when tasting the Pinot Hill East and West. This tasting is only offered once a year\, so don’t miss out!
