SUMMARY:Apple Rose Tarts Demo with Alli Keyser-Marti at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate apple season by joining Gold Ridge Organic Farms’ pastry chef Alli Keyser-Marti for a demonstration-style class on making apple rose tarts. You’ll learn the key techniques and tricks\, so you can confidently recreate these beautiful pastries at home. \nWhat to expect:\n*A hands-on demonstration in our charming Apple Cottage kitchen\n*Insider tips on creating delicious apple pastries\n*Tasting of the finished product\n*A scenic ride from our Farm Shop to the Apple Cottage in our apple-themed trolley\n*10% off all Farm Shop purchases on the day of the workshop \nAlli Keyser-Marti worked as a pastry chef in Michelin-starred restaurants in Sonoma County. Her expertise extends beyond pastry to cheese — she’s a Certified Cheese Professional® and an ACS Certified Cheese Sensory Evaluator®. In 2023\, she judged cheese for the Good Food Awards. You’ll find her at Gold Ridge Organic Farms pairing cheese\, olive oil\, and apples with the same precision she brings to the kitchen. \nWe do our best to run every class as scheduled. If we don’t reach minimum enrollment\, we’ll notify you at least 24 hours in advance and offer a full refund.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/apple-rose-tarts-demo-with-alli-keyser-marti-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Apple-Rose-Tart.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Gold Ridge Organic Farms":MAILTO:info@goldridgeorganicfarms.com
END:VEVENT
