SUMMARY:Talk with Your Mouth Full - Monthly Dinner Series: Built for Families\, Open to Everyone
DESCRIPTION:St. Stephen’s monthly dinner series returns on Thursday\, July 30th\, offering families an easy\, stress-free way to connect\, enjoy a great meal\, and learn together. We designed these gatherings specifically around the needs of busy families with young children — which is why the event starts early at 5 pm and includes a free dinner and complimentary childcare for all attendees. Anyone is welcome to attend. Please RSVP before July 23 – https://forms.gle/doPdEeiwbqQCApCEA so we can make sure there is enough food! \nJuly Focus: Gender and Identity 101\nThis month\, we are thrilled to welcome speakers from Positive Images who will present their Gender and Identity 101 workshop. \nThis supportive session is designed to help parents\, caregivers\, and community members better understand and support LGBTQIA+ youth. Participants will learn about gender identity\, sexual orientation\, pronouns\, and inclusive language\, while gaining practical tools to create affirming spaces where young people feel seen\, supported\, and empowered. \nSt. Stephen’s mission with this series is to provide an accessible space to form friendships and deepen community bonds. There is absolutely no expectation of joining the church. We believe that we don’t all need to be on the same journey\, spiritual or otherwise\, to learn from one another and be good neighbors. We hope the connections made here will continue to grow at Wylde Provisions Cafe + Playground and throughout our wider community! \nWhen: Thursday\, July 30th-dinner at 5 pm\, speaker5:45 pm \nWhere: St. Stephen’s Episcopal Church\, 500 Robinson Road\, Sebastopol \nPerks: Free dinner and free childcare provided. \nRSVP: Required by Thursday\, July 23rd. Please RSVP here: https://forms.gle/doPdEeiwbqQCApCEA
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/talk-with-your-mouth-full-monthly-dinner-series-built-for-families-open-to-everyone/
LOCATION:St Stephen’s Episcopal Church\, 500 Robinson Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Early Childhood (0-4),Kids (5-12)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7-30-Talk-with-your-mouth-full.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="St. Stephen's Episcopal Church":MAILTO:office@StStephensSebastopol.org
END:VEVENT
