SUMMARY:The Art of Bundle Dyeing: Silk Scarves
DESCRIPTION:Discover the magic of botanical color with Hanna the Wool Witch. Using flowers and natural dye materials\, you’ll create one-of-a-kind patterns on silk through the traditional process of bundle dyeing. \nIn this workshop you’ll:\n• Learn the fundamentals of botanical bundle dyeing\n• Create one-of-a-kind designs using flowers and natural dyes\n• Explore color\, pattern\, and botanical design \nTake home two hand-dyed silk scarves in different sizes.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-bundle-dyeing-silk-scarves/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Bundle-Dyed-Scarves.png
END:VEVENT
